  , adsAnalyticsCreateAsyncRequestReportingUnderscoretimezone :: Maybe ReportingTimeZone -- ^ Specify the timezone to be applied for the reporting. This feature is currently in BETA and is not available to all users.
  , adsAnalyticsCreateAsyncRequestStartUnderscorehour :: Maybe Int -- ^ Which hour of the start date to begin the report. The entire day will be included if no start hour is provided. Only allowed for hourly reports.
